source_status = "PUBLIC: system designation and broad role; see docs/REALISM.md. GAMEPLAY_ESTIMATE: every range, gain and classification figure here is a tuning value, not a performance claim. A dipping set only works with the aircraft stopped and low, which is the whole helicopter ASW cycle."
